  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Validation and action roadmap PADEO</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of the Programmatic Approach Sustainable Economic Development (PADEO) is to collaborate with key local stakeholders, including youth representatives and those often overlooked, to develop a Dutch development approach that will enhance youth employment in Tunisia. The approach includes a vision, strategy, and action plan based on insights gathered from local workshops.The PADEO pilot in Tunisia concentrates on promoting youth employment in the agri-food sector. The project aims to validate the PADEO leverage point findings from previous multi-stakeholder workshops (PSS22TN02) and create a 4-year implementable PADEO strategy and plan for the Ministry of Ecology, Sustainable Development, the Netherlands Embassy in Dakar, and the Netherlands Enterprise Agency. The goal is to make working in agriculture attractive to young people and increase youth employment in the agricultural sector in Tunisia.</narrative>
  </description>
